  "prefLabel": "We 802.01 Applicability",
  "priorExpiration": "1996-12-22",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 802.01 Applicability.\n\n(a) “Well Completion Report” shall be submitted to the water well board in accordance with We 801 for all test or exploration wells associated with the development of drinking water supplies.\n\n(b) “Well Completion Reports” shall be submitted to the water well board for the deepest monitoring well constructed at each property or place of business, and for each monitoring well constructed into bedrock at each property or place of business.\n\nSource. #4418, eff 5-2-88; ss by #4730, eff 1-15-90; ss by #4898, eff 8-13-90; EXPIRED: 8-13-96\n\nNew. #6327, INTERIM, eff 8-24-96, EXPIRED: 12-22-96\n\nNew. #6449, eff 1-29-97; ss by #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9179, eff 6-13-08; ss by #12083, eff 3-1-17 (See Revision Notes at Chapter headings for We 300 and We 600)",
